	(text "SPEC.md 8.2, DECISIONS.md D022. 0-500 V bus -> 4x 750k + 12.0k series string (1.992 V at 500 V, 124.5 V and 20.7 mW per 1206 part, 83 mW total) -> AMC1311BDWV reinforced isolated amplifier -> diff-to-single-ended stage -> V_BUS."
